(2, 'flopcem0arm0lfvbnao26gctj6', 'Hii', 'Ankit.y.2302@gmail.com', '9137580969', 'I am looking for job', '/failed', 'Visitor: I am looking for job Assistant: Thanks Hii, your details have been saved. Let me help you with that. You can explore current career opportunities and job-related details on our [[Career Opportunities|https://technofra.com/career]] page. If you want, I can also help you with the application or contact process. Visitor: Not working Assistant: Yes, you can review our recent work and portfolio examples here: [[Portfolio|https://technofra.com/portfolio]]. If you share your industry or requirement, I can also suggest the most relevant service category. Visitor: Can i talk real person Assistant: You can connect with our team on +91 8080 80 3374 or +91 8080 80 3375. You may also use our [[Contact Page|https://technofra.com/contact]], schedule a discussion via [[Book a Call|https://technofra.com/book-a-call]], or message us on [[WhatsApp|https://wa.me/918080721003]]. Visitor: Can i talk real person', 'Can i talk real person', '2026-05-12 05:36:17', '2026-05-12 05:36:42'),
