(7, 'loh5e651nh6tr7k4kr6ct9re9j', 'hii', 'manish@technofra.com', '8080721003', 'aap domain hosting provide karte ho', '/', 'Visitor: aap domain hosting provide karte ho Assistant: Thanks hii, your details have been saved. Let me help you with that. Technofra provides the following core services: - Website Development: [[Website Development|https://technofra.com/web-design]] - App Development: [[App Development|https://technofra.com/android-app-development]] - Branding & UI/UX: [[Branding & UI/UX|https://technofra.com/branding]] - Digital Marketing & SEO: [[Digital Marketing & SEO|https://technofra.com/digital-marketing]] - Social Media Marketing: [[Social Media Marketing|https://technofra.com/smm]] - Payment Gateway Integration: [[Payment Gateway Integration|https://tec Visitor: aap domain hosting provide karte ho', 'aap domain hosting provide karte ho', '2026-06-17 08:00:52', '2026-06-17 08:00:52'),
(8, 'pfjotqfrs559075gkcb67ppe94', 'hi', 'hi@abc.com', '9638527410', 'can i buy a laptop', '/', 'Visitor: hi Visitor: can i buy a laptop Assistant: Thanks hi, your details have been saved. Let me help you with that. Thank you for your message. You are currently browsing our home page. Please let me know whether you need website development, app development, branding, marketing, payment integration, or chatbot support. Visitor: app Assistant: Our team develops Android and iOS applications for startups, businesses, and enterprise use cases. You can explore our [[App Development|https://technofra.com/android-app-development]] services for more details. Visitor: app', 'app', '2026-06-18 04:44:49', '2026-06-18 04:45:15'),
